# contAIner - Environment Variables Template
# All variables are OPTIONAL for training.
# Copy to .env if you need to override defaults.

# OPTIONAL: GitHub Personal Access Token.
# Purpose: Used ONLY for corpus building (src/rl_env/corpus.py, scripts/build_corpus.py)
# to query the GitHub Search API without hitting unauthenticated rate limits.
# NOT used or needed for System 2 training on prebuilt corpus manifests.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# OPTIONAL: Hugging Face User Access Token.
# Purpose: Used only when downloading gated models, pushing datasets to Hugging Face Hub,
# or avoiding HF Hub anonymous rate limits. Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct is public and does not require a token.
# HF_TOKEN=

# OPTIONAL: Groq / Grok API Key.
# Purpose: Used ONLY by the Electron demo bridge (electron_app/bridge/grok.py) for interactive
# user query clarification and fallback dialogue. NOT used during training or RL evaluation.
# GROK_API_KEY=
